# BUGS

`Rgetattr`'s <uid> and <gid> are 0, though <valid> says they are set and fsd(4) keeps owners, so `ls -l` and `stat` show every file as root's.

<request_mask> is ignored, the times have no nanoseconds though fsd(4) keeps them, the change time is the modification time, and <nlink> is 1 or 2 whatever the file.

`Twstat` is refused by every server and never sent by the client, so permissions and lengths cannot be changed between VectraOS and a 9P2000 system such as 9front or `u9fs`, in either direction.
